.Dd May 29, 2026
.Dt WHISPER-CTL 8
.Os zdots
.Sh NAME
.Nm whisper-ctl
.Nd manage local whisper.cpp transcription support
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar command
.Sh COMMANDS
.Bl -tag -width model-download
.It Cm install
Install whisper.cpp.
.It Cm model-download
Download active model.
.It Cm model-list
List models.
.It Cm transcribe Ar audio_file
Transcribe audio.
.It Cm config
Print resolved configuration.
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width ZDOTS_WHISPER_URL_PREFIX
.It Ev ZDOTS_WHISPER_PROFILE
Active profile.
.It Ev ZDOTS_WHISPER_MODELS_DIR
Model storage directory.
.It Ev ZDOTS_WHISPER_MODEL_FILE
Model filename.
.It Ev ZDOTS_WHISPER_HF_REPO
HuggingFace repository.
.It Ev ZDOTS_WHISPER_URL_PREFIX
Download URL prefix.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr zdots-ai-stack 7
